  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/cmRWhN4.png\" alt=\"YUNG的橋樑\" width=\"1344\" height=\"416\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/yungs-api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://tinyurl.com/yungsapibadge\" alt=\"需依賴YUNG's API\" width=\"211\" height=\"26\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://discord.gg/rns3beq\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://tinyurl.com/yungsdiscordbadge2\" alt=\"加入YUNG GANG Discord群組！\" width=\"136\" height=\"28\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://twitter.com/yungnickyoung\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://tinyurl.com/yungstwitterbadge3\" alt=\"追蹤我的Twitter！\" width=\"76\" height=\"27\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCmEhjcMNhSDTRJgjVfbs9Rw\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://tinyurl.com/yungsyoutubebadge\" alt=\"訂閱我的YouTube頻道！\" width=\"80\" height=\"30\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://patreon.com/yungnickyoung\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://tinyurl.com/yungspatreonbadge\" alt=\"在Patreon贊助我！\" width=\"138\" height=\"28\"></a></p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Ug8dC9A.png\" alt=\"這是什麼？\" width=\"1125\" height=\"59\"></p><p>YUNG的橋樑是首個為Minecraft添加自然生成橋樑的模組。探索世界並發現超過15種不同類型的橋樑，每種都有對應生態域的獨特變體！</p><p><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/4aMS_7aq3ws?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ladFuIF.png\" alt=\"兼容性\" width=\"1125\" height=\"59\"></p><p>YUNG的橋樑設計為與所有地形生成模組完全兼容，包括：</p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/yungs-better-mineshafts-forge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">YUNG的更好的礦井</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/yungs-better-strongholds\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">YUNG的更好的要塞</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/yungs-better-dungeons\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">YUNG的更好的地牢</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/yungs-extras\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">YUNG的額外內容</a></li>\n<li>生態域大冒險</li>\n<li>豐富生態域</li>\n<li>Terraforged：會生成狹窄且岸邊陡峭的河流。橋樑仍可能生成，但建議調高生成率測試。</li>\n<li>Upstream：會生成非常寬闊的河流——實際上多數橋樑都難以生成。建議嘗試調高生成率，特別是大型橋樑。多數情況下，只有在河流中央有島嶼等地形時才會看到橋樑生成。</li>\n<li>Terralith：會生成岸邊較陡峭的河流。橋樑仍可能生成，但建議調高生成率測試。</li>\n</ul><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fessential.gg%252fx%252fyung\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/2mVOWMC.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1230\" height=\"241\"></a></p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/a49IMQJ.png\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fyung\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/nQRs7ZP.png\" alt=\"使用優惠碼YUNGNICKYOUNG可享Bisect Hosting 25%折扣！\" width=\"1344\" height=\"400\"></a></p>",
